! mcp_bootstrap_p299.strap -- MCP printed page 299: the tail of the
! ZDSN (disregard system tape mounting) routine, then THE SPECIAL
! ASSIGNMENT COMMON PACKAGE (ZCOM01 .. ZCOM98), lines 1-47.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.50, read at 400 dpi.  Header, READ:
! "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 11D11MCP  CARD ID QJ000099  DIST. OF 3/01
! 3/01  PAGE NUMBER 299" (round glyphs in numeric fields read 0).  The
! heading row's LOCATION field prints 233052, line 1's word.
!
! THE PAGE.  47 lines, every line number prints a "*" after it.  Located
! rows run contiguous from 233052.40 (line 1) to 233106.00 (line 47, an
! XW, the last word of the page; next location 233107.00).  Line 12 is
! "Z DSN 05 (IQS*)DD(BU), DISREGARD SYSTEM TAPE MOUNTING REQUESTS*" at
! 233062.40, printing no binary.  Written as printed, blank after the
! comma kept: 40 characters = 320 bits = 5 words, matching line 10's
! CF,5.0; line 21's 233067.40 does not discriminate (39 characters
! would also round up to it).  Lines 13-20 are remark cards (a banner "THE
! SPECIAL ASSIGNMENT COMMON PACKAGE" between rows of asterisks, then
! "CALLING LINKAGE / SIC,Z COM 99  B,Z COM 01").  "*" after the LOCATION
! on lines 6, 27 and 47.
!
! JOIN.  p.298 (scratch image, PDF p.49, no deck yet) ends with line 50
! CM0000(BU,7),SRD($1) at 233051.40, a full word: line 1's 233052.40
! continues it.  p.298 line 42/43 "Z DSN 01 SIC,ZCOM99 / B,ZCOM01" print
! 233077.40 / 233067.50 and lines 45-46 branch to ZCOM19 233103.34 --
! this page's ZCOM99 233077.40, ZCOM01 233067.40, ZCOM19 233103.00.
! p.297 (b7decks) agrees: ZCOM99 233077.40, ZCOM01 233067.50 (B),
! ZCOM98 233105.0.  p.300 opens a new package (card ID QK000001, line 1
! a banner); its first location is not checked here.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * "Z CCM 95" (lines 1, 11), "Z CCM 90" (line 23), "Z CCM 99" (line
!     42): the drum's open O; ZCOM95/ZCOM90/ZCOM99 as p.297 defines
!     them, and the same page prints "Z COM 90/99/01" closed (lines 19,
!     27, 36).  Binaries 232761.32 / 232761.10 / 232762.04 / 233077.50
!     are those labels.
!   * "Z CSN 05", "Z CSN 09" (lines 6, 9, 11, 12): ZDSN05 / ZDSN09, D with
!     a worn stem.  C22-6728 names the family ZDSN01 ("ZASN01 and
!     ZDSN01", as p.232's header records), and p.298 line 42 prints
!     "Z DSN 01" with a stem.  Digit 0 by the numbered family.
!   * "Z IOD H" (line 25) = ZIODH (landed p.179 line 8); comment "-IOD".
!   * "S I MNT" = SIMNT, "S UN A A" = SUNAA, "S CHAN N" = SCHANN, "S X
!     CHAN" = SXCHAN, "S BA MCP" = SBAMCP, "S MULTI" = SMULTI, "S UNIT N"
!     = SUNITN, "S ASN ER" = SASNER, "S DISIC" = SDISIC, "S DISP" = SDISP,
!     "S DISPO" = SDISPO, "D MCP" = DMCP, "D COMM" = DCOMM: spaces are
!     the drum's, spellings as landed.
!   * CMOCOO / CMOC00 (lines 3-5) = CM0000; "CF,5.0" prints CC0005 =
!     000005; octal fields "CCCCCC.CC" read 0; hex "CO", "FO", "DO" =
!     C0, F0, D0.
!
! CARD SERIALS.  QJ000099 .. QJ000144, line N prints QJ0000(98+N) for
! lines 1-44; lines 44 AND 45 both print QJ000142 (read at 400 dpi,
! clear), so lines 45-47 print 142-144.  Recorded, not explained.

SDISPO  SYN(BU,1), 0.27              ! p.99 line 25
STATI   SYN(BU,1), 0.26              ! p.99 line 23
SMOUNT  SYN(BU,1), 0.51              ! p.99 line 42 -MOUNT TAPE
SIMNT   SYN(BU,1), 0.53              ! p.99 line 44
SMULTI  SYN(BU,1), 0.27              ! p.99 line 24 -MULTI-UNIT CHAN
SUNAA   SYN(BU,25), 0.0              ! p.99 line 19 -UNIT AREA TABLE FIELD
SCHANN  SYN(BU,7), 0.12              ! p.101 line 5 -CHANNEL NUMBER
SUNITN  SYN(BU,3), 0.47              ! p.101 line 6 -UNIT NUMBER
SXCHAN  SYN(BU), (8)215002.0         ! landed p.103 line 28 "SXCHAN XW,0" (as p.289); V+ line 33 215002.02
SBAMCP  SYN(B,25,1), (8)215003.0     ! landed p.103 line 31 "SBAMCP VF,SMCP" at 215003.00; V+ line 28 215003.02
DMCP    SYN, 32.0                    ! landed p.108; B line 7 000040.10
DCOMM   SYN, 35.32                   ! landed p.105 line 23; line 8 000043.40
SASNER  SYN, (16)0802.0              ! landed p.107 line 36; LVI line 43 004002.35
SDISIC  SYN(B,25,1), (8)217451.40    ! landed p.148 line 19 "SDISIC VF,0"; SIC line 44 217451.40
SDISP   SYN(BU,64,8), (8)217372.0    ! landed p.147 line 5 (BB1, full word) at 217372.00; BD line 45 217372.04
ZIODH   SYN(BU,32,8), (8)221002.0    ! landed p.179 line 8 (LVI, half word); BXVZ line 25 221002.31
ZCOM95  SYN(BU,32,8), (8)232761.0    ! p.297 line 25 (LX, half word); BXE line 1 232761.32, B line 11 232761.10
ZCOM90  SYN(BU,32,8), (8)232762.0    ! p.297 line 27 (B, half word); LV line 23 232762.04, SVA line 27 232762.05

        SLC, (8)233052.40
        BXE,ZCOM95                                           ! line  1  -BRANCH IF SINGLE-UNIT CHANNEL  (printed "Z CCM 95")
        CM1111,SDISPO($1)                                    ! line  2
        CM0000,STATI($1)                                     ! line  3
        CM0000,SMOUNT($1)                                    ! line  4
        CM0000,SIMNT($1)                                     ! line  5
        BZBN,ZDSN05,ZDSN09                                   ! line  6  -TEST FOR ONE MESSAGE  (printed "Z CSN")
        B,DMCP                                               ! line  7
        ,DCOMM                                               ! line  8
        VF,ZDSN05                                            ! line  9
        CF,5.0                                               ! line 10
ZDSN09  B,ZCOM95                                             ! line 11  (printed "Z CCM 95")
ZDSN05  (IQS*)DD(BU), DISREGARD SYSTEM TAPE MOUNTING REQUESTS*  ! line 12
! line 13  -
! line 14  - ******************************************************
! line 15  - THE SPECIAL ASSIGNMENT COMMON PACKAGE
! line 16  - ******************************************************
! line 17  -
